Patch 7906 (experimental): reject async Matching2 work after context ownership ends.

Persistent owner epochs and serialized state commits; peer registration takes the
adapter lock before state. Lifecycle invalidation does not wait for that adapter lock.
Queued callbacks, same-owner room ordering and server cancellation remain separate.

